% knights
%
% The Logical English (for LPS) twin of an Epilog game, written by the Epilog translator
% from knights.hrf (kept in sources/): the operations are causal laws, the
% views over the state intensional fluents.
% The scenario is a play EpilogJS made; LPS2's final state of it is checked against EpilogJS's
% (test_epilog.pl).
% Source: the Epilog Games page, http://epilog.stanford.edu/homepage/game.php?game=knights
%
% DISCLAIMER. This program was written by a translator from a program of another
% system. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
% implied, including any warranty that it is accurate, complete or fit for a
% particular purpose. The translation may be wrong: check it against its source
% before relying on it. It is not legal, tax, insurance, financial or other
% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move move with *a file*, *a rank*, *a thing* and *a second thing* is made; known as move.

the fluents are:
    *a file* cell *a rank* with *a role*; known as cell.
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    *a role* is the score of *a thing*; known as score.
    blackwin; known as blackwin.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    *a role* is a hasanypiece; known as hasanypiece.
    the move move with *a file*, *a rank*, *a thing* and *a second thing* is legal; known as legal_move.
    whitewin; known as whitewin.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *a thing* whitemove *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.
    *a thing* blackmove *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*.
    the nextrank of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    *a thing* is the nextfile of *a second thing*.
    the skiprank of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    *a thing* is the skipfile of *a second thing*.
    the incr of *a thing* is *a second thing*.

the knowledge base knights includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/knights.hrf".

a thing whitemove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing is the skipfile of the third thing
    and the nextrank of the second thing is the fourth thing.

a thing whitemove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the third thing is the skipfile of the thing
    and the nextrank of the second thing is the fourth thing.

a thing whitemove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the skiprank of the second thing is the fourth thing
    and the thing is the nextfile of the third thing.

a thing whitemove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the skiprank of the second thing is the fourth thing
    and the third thing is the nextfile of the thing.

a thing blackmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the thing is the skipfile of the third thing
    and the nextrank of the fourth thing is the second thing.

a thing blackmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the third thing is the skipfile of the thing
    and the nextrank of the fourth thing is the second thing.

a thing blackmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the skiprank of the fourth thing is the second thing
    and the thing is the nextfile of the third thing.

a thing blackmove a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing if
    the skiprank of the fourth thing is the second thing
    and the third thing is the nextfile of the thing.

the nextrank of 1 is 2.

the nextrank of 2 is 3.

the nextrank of 3 is 4.

the nextrank of 4 is 5.

the nextrank of 5 is 6.

"a" is the nextfile of b.

b is the nextfile of c.

c is the nextfile of d.

d is the nextfile of e.

e is the nextfile of f.

the skiprank of 1 is 3.

the skiprank of 2 is 4.

the skiprank of 3 is 5.

the skiprank of 4 is 6.

"a" is the skipfile of c.

b is the skipfile of d.

c is the skipfile of e.

d is the skipfile of f.

the incr of 0 is 10.

the incr of 10 is 20.

the incr of 20 is 30.

the incr of 30 is 40.

the incr of 40 is 50.

the incr of 50 is 60.

the incr of 60 is 70.

the incr of 70 is 80.

the incr of 80 is 90.

the incr of 90 is 100.

the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is legal at a time if
    white is a control at the time
    and the file cell the rank with white at the time
    and the file whitemove the rank with the thing with the second thing
    and it is not the case that the thing cell the second thing with white at the time.

the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is legal at a time if
    black is a control at the time
    and the file cell the rank with black at the time
    and the file blackmove the rank with the thing with the second thing
    and it is not the case that the thing cell the second thing with black at the time.

the goal of a role is a number at a time if
    the role is the score of the number at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    whitewin at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    blackwin at the time.

whitewin at a time if
    a file cell 6 with white at the time.

whitewin at a time if
    it is not the case that black is a hasanypiece at the time.

blackwin at a time if
    a file cell 1 with black at the time.

blackwin at a time if
    it is not the case that white is a hasanypiece at the time.

a role is a hasanypiece at a time if
    a file cell a rank with the role at the time.

when the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is made
    and a role is a control
then the thing cell the second thing with the role
    and it is not the case that the file cell the rank with the role.

when the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is made
    and the thing cell the second thing with a role
then it is not the case that the thing cell the second thing with the role.

when the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is made
    and the thing cell the second thing with a role
    and a second role is a control
    and the second role is the score of a third thing
    and the incr of the third thing is a fourth thing
then the second role is the score of the fourth thing
    and it is not the case that the second role is the score of the third thing.

when the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is made
    and white is a control
then black is a control
    and it is not the case that white is a control.

when the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is made
    and black is a control
then white is a control
    and it is not the case that black is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move move with a file, a rank, a thing and a second thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move move with the file, the rank, the thing and the second thing is legal.

initially b cell 1 with white
    and c cell 1 with white
    and d cell 1 with white
    and e cell 1 with white
    and "a" cell 2 with white
    and b cell 2 with white
    and c cell 2 with white
    and d cell 2 with white
    and e cell 2 with white
    and f cell 2 with white
    and "a" cell 5 with black
    and b cell 5 with black
    and c cell 5 with black
    and d cell 5 with black
    and e cell 5 with black
    and f cell 5 with black
    and b cell 6 with black
    and c cell 6 with black
    and d cell 6 with black
    and e cell 6 with black
    and white is the score of 0
    and black is the score of 0
    and white is a control.

