scenario play is:
    the move move with "a", 2, b and 4 is made from 1 to 2.
    the move move with c, 5, "a" and 4 is made from 2 to 3.
    the move move with d, 1, c and 3 is made from 3 to 4.
    the move move with e, 6, f and 4 is made from 4 to 5.
    the move move with b, 2, "a" and 4 is made from 5 to 6.
    the move move with e, 5, c and 4 is made from 6 to 7.
    the move move with d, 2, e and 4 is made from 7 to 8.
    the move move with c, 6, b and 4 is made from 8 to 9.
    the move move with e, 1, f and 3 is made from 9 to 10.
    the move move with b, 5, d and 4 is made from 10 to 11.
    the move move with c, 2, "a" and 3 is made from 11 to 12.
    the move move with f, 4, d and 3 is made from 12 to 13.

